      "reading_order": 8,
      "text": "6. Atomic number 19 $\\rightarrow$ 2, 8, 8, 1 (group 1)\nAtomic number 15 $\\rightarrow$ 2, 8, 5 (group 15)\nAtomic number 16 $\\rightarrow$ 2, 8, 6 (group 16)\nAtomic number 9 $\\rightarrow$ 2, 7 (group 17)\nThe order is ABCD.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
