        "y2": 2453.0
      },
      "layout_tag": "paragraph",
      "confidence": 0.9259061813354492,
      "reading_order": 10,
      "text": "8. Ionization energies of representative elements\ngenerally increase along a period since differ-\nentiating electrons enter the same shell and\nthereby the effective nuclear charges increase.\nHence, the correct option is (a)."
    },
